OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum given funds for urgent
OL,4,Arepairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA museum has been awarded funds so its
OL,7,Fheating system can be repaired and
OL,8,Fprevent the venue being forced to
OL,9,Fclose.
OL,11,FExeter's Royal Albert Memorial Museum
OL,12,F(RAMM) is to receive #260,000 from
OL,13,FExeter City Council to upgrade its
OL,14,Fheating and cooling systems.
OL,16,FThe museum said the upgrade was part of
OL,17,Fits commitment to decarbonising but
OL,18,Fwould also help it maintain the correct
OL,19,Fclimate for both visitors and the
OL,20,Fmuseum's treasures for years to come.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
